+### Compound Format
+
+Pass `compound: true` to get multiple parts, largest unit first. Parts run from days down to seconds, zero parts are skipped, and leftover milliseconds are dropped. It only applies to the short format, so it is ignored when `long` is set.
+
+```ts
+ms(5400000, { compound: true })       // "1h 30m"
+ms(90061000, { compound: true })      // "1d 1h 1m 1s"
+ms(-5400000, { compound: true })      // "-1h 30m"
+ms(999, { compound: true })           // "0s"
+```
+
 ### Input Formats (Units)
 
 ```ts
